@startuml
!include _style.iuml
' Adapted from reviewed presentation sources: W3-03, W3-06a, W3-06; upload pin / replay corrections from W3-review
skinparam dpi 110
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam ClassAttributeFontSize 17
skinparam ClassStereotypeFontSize 15
skinparam NoteFontSize 16
skinparam LegendFontSize 15
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam maxMessageSize 165
skinparam nodesep 36
skinparam ranksep 56
hide footbox
hide circle
title UC-1 · implemented adoption records and functions
top to bottom direction
class "direct_intake\nmedia.services" as I <<module>> $MEDIA {
 {static} + reserve(session, storage, owner_id, request)
 {static} + finalize(session, storage, owner_id,\n reservation_id, request, *, enqueue=None)
}
class "Storage\nmedia.services.storage" as S <<adapter>> $MEDIA {
 + direct_upload_grant(reservation)
 + verify_direct_upload(reservation,\n *, check_content=True)
}
class "UploadReservation" as R <<ORM>> $MEDIA {
 + id: UUID
 + owner_id: UUID
 + request_id: UUID
 + asset_id: UUID
 + version_id: str | None
 + finalized_at: datetime | None
}
class "Asset\nmedia.models" as A <<ORM>> $MEDIA {
 + id: UUID
 + owner_id: UUID
 + source_key: str
 + source_sha256: str
}
class "MediaOutbox" as O <<outbox>> $MEDIA {
 + message_id: UUID
 + queue: str
 + body: dict
}
I -down-> S
I .right.> R : locks / pins
I ..> A : inserts
S -[hidden]down- O
I ..> O : enqueue_submit\n→ stage
R "0..1" -down- "0..1" A : logical asset_id
legend bottom
Selected Mapped[T] fields shown as T; underlined operations are
module functions.
UploadReservation: media.upload_models; MediaOutbox:
media.messaging_models.
Reservation asset_id is unique; it is allocated before the Asset
exists, with no FK.
endlegend
@enduml
